{"id":11741,"mal_id":11741,"title":"Fate/Zero 2nd Season","englishTitle":"Fate/Zero Season 2","title_english":"Fate/Zero Season 2","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Fate/Zero Second Season"],"en":"Fate/Zero Season 2","ja":"フェイト/ゼロ 2ndシーズン"},"synopsis":"As the Fourth Holy Grail War rages on with no clear victor in sight, the remaining Servants and their Masters are called upon by Church supervisor Risei Kotomine, in order to band together and confront an impending threat that could unravel the Grail War and bring about the destruction of Fuyuki City. The uneasy truce soon collapses as Masters demonstrate that they will do anything in their power, no matter how despicable, to win.\n\nSeeds of doubt are sown between Kiritsugu Emiya and Saber, his Servant, as their conflicting ideologies on heroism and chivalry clash. Meanwhile, an ominous bond forms between Kirei Kotomine, who still seeks to find his purpose in life, and one of the remaining Servants. As the countdown to the end of the war reaches zero, the cost of winning begins to blur the line between victory and defeat.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Mientras la Cuarta Guerra del Santo Grial continúa sin un vencedor claro a la vista, los Servants restantes y sus Maestros son llamados por el supervisor de la Iglesia, Risei Kotomine, para unirse y enfrentar una amenaza inminente que podría desentrañar la Guerra del Grial y provocar la destrucción de la ciudad de Fuyuki. La incómoda tregua pronto colapsa cuando Masters demuestra que harán todo lo que esté en su poder, por despreciable que sea, para ganar.\n\nSe siembran semillas de duda entre Kiritsugu Emiya y Saber, su Servant, mientras sus ideologías en conflicto sobre el heroísmo y la caballerosidad chocan. Mientras tanto, se forma un vínculo siniestro entre Kirei Kotomine, que todavía busca encontrar su propósito en la vida, y uno de los Servants restantes. A medida que la cuenta regresiva para el final de la guerra llega a cero, el costo de ganar comienza a desdibujar la línea entre la victoria y la derrota.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1440,"average_episode_duration":1440,"startDate":"2012-04-08","start_date":"2012-04-08","endDate":"2012-06-24","end_date":"2012-06-24","season":"spring","year":2012,"start_season":{"year":2012,"season":"spring"},"episodes":12,"num_episodes":12,"score":8.53,"mean":8.53,"numListUsers":1212066,"num_list_users":1212066,"genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action"},{"id":10,"name":"Fantasy"},{"id":82,"name":"Urban Fantasy"}],"studios":[{"id":43,"name":"ufotable"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":null,"logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":null,"tmdb_updated_at":null,"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1522/117645.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1522/117645l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1522/117645.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1522/117645l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1522/117645l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"sunday","time":"00:00","day_of_the_week":"sunday","start_time":"00:00","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"sunday 00:00"},"rank":147,"popularity":140,"rating":"r","simkl_id":null,"episodes_data":[],"specials_data":[],"characters":[],"num_scoring_users":766452,"nsfw":"white","created_at":"2011-10-08T08:44:50+00:00","updated_at":"2024-10-02T16:12:27+00:00","source":"light_novel","background":null,"related_anime":[{"node":{"id":356,"title":"Fate/stay night","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/4/30327.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/4/30327l.webp"}},"relation_type":"sequel","relation_type_formatted":"Sequel"},{"node":{"id":6922,"title":"Fate/stay night Movie: Unlimited Blade Works","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1889/95111.webp","large